label: "ADRs (atomic keyspace, streams, streaming I/O, batched deletion)"
statement: >
  docs/decisions/ — ADR 0001 (atomic keyspace), 0002 (streams), 0003
  (streaming-value I/O, proposed draft), 0004 (streaming-value I/O v2,
  supersedes 0003), and 0005 (unconditional S3 multi-object deletion,
  proposed). Append-only; supersede, never edit. Each is registered as a
  Decision vertex in situation/record/ (decision-0001…decision-0005);
  liveness is read from status and supersedes edges — 0001, 0002, and 0004
  are live, 0003 is superseded, and 0005 is proposed. Walk the chain before
  relitigating any of these choices.
path:
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/docs/decisions"
